      "title": "SpotMeter",
      "previous": {
        "modVersion": "5.6.2",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.2.1.3",
        "fileName": "spotmeter-v5.6.2.wotmod",
        "updatedAt": "2026-05-17T09:52:59.915Z",
        "changeLog": "Compatibility update for World of Tanks 2.2.1.3.\nNo functional or behavioral changes vs v5.6.1 — only the target game version was bumped and the .pyc recompiled."
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "v6.0.0",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.3.0.0",
        "fileName": "spotmeter-v6.0.0.wotmod",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-08T09:21:08.664Z",
        "changeLog": "v6.0.0 - built for WoT 2.3.0.0.\n\nA major update on top of the minimap spot-distance circle:\n\nNEW\n- In-battle picker panel: lists every enemy with its view range; identical tanks group into one row. Shows the spot-distance of the picked target (or your own tank). Pick by clicking a row or with Numpad 2/8. Draggable.\n- Garage panel: pre-configure perk/equipment levels before battle, with a live preview.\n- PageDown: show/hide the panel (battle + garage); stays hidden until pressed again.\n- Auto-pick (Numpad /): auto-targets the nearest enemy, with per-class presets.\n- Optics / Vents / CVS as manual cyclable levels (Numpad 6 / + / -).\n- Auto-hide while holding TAB/N or when garage windows are open.\n- English + Polish interface, auto-detected from the client.\n\nFIXED\n- Panel no longer reappears by itself after being hidden with PageDown.\n- Garage performance cleanup."
      }
    },
